---
/** Textlogga – byt mot <img> när en riktig logga finns (se README). */
---
<a href="/" class="logo" aria-label="A.R.E Rekond – till startsidan">
  <span class="logo__mark">A.R.E</span> <span class="logo__word">Rekond</span><span class="logo__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
</a>

<style>
  .logo {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 0.35em;
    color: var(--text);
    text-decoration: none;
    font-family: var(--font-head);
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    line-height: 1;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .logo__mark { font-weight: 900; font-stretch: 120%; letter-spacing: 0.02em; }
  .logo__word { font-weight: 400; font-stretch: 100%; color: var(--muted); letter-spacing: 0.04em; }
  .logo__dot {
    width: 0.32em;
    height: 0.32em;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--accent);
    box-shadow: 0 0 12px var(--accent);
    margin-left: -0.15em;
  }
  .logo:hover .logo__word { color: var(--text); }
</style>
